{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Founder's Package: Deluxe grants you not only early access to Game of Thrones: Kingsroad but practical items and unique cosmetics/customization items that will aid you and make you stand out throughout your adventures in Westeros.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become a Founder of Game of Thrones: Kingsroad now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deluxe package contains the following:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Early Access to Game of Thrones: Kingsroad</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Battle Pass Premium</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Northern Outfit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Wandering Crow Outfit </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Mount: Darkcloud</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Nameplate Background: Ghost</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Nameplate Frame: Harbinger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Emoji Pack - Jon Snow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Iron Bank Marks x750</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Copper x50,000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Iron Bank Marks and Copper are virtual currencies used to purchase a wide variety of in-game items.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3508440?t=1742973273","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3508440?t=1742973273","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508440/2c533f3143aad4ca28b549bebfeeab5139792983/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742973273","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508440/2c533f3143aad4ca28b549bebfeeab5139792983/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742973273","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Game of Thrones: Kingsroad is an action-adventure RPG where players explore Westeros, grow into heirs through battles against threats beyond the Wall and various factions, and rebuild their houses. While performing missions, players use a variety of weapons (swords, axes, daggers, longbows, crossbows) to kill enemies. The combat process and battle scenes include realistic visual and auditory depictions of violence, which may feature blood, bloodstains, and corpses."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Founder's Package: Deluxe grants you not only early access to Game of Thrones: Kingsroad but practical items and unique cosmetics/customization items that will aid you and make you stand out throughout your adventures in Westeros.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become a Founder of Game of Thrones: Kingsroad now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deluxe package contains the following:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Early Access to Game of Thrones: Kingsroad</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Battle Pass Premium</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Northern Outfit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Wandering Crow Outfit </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Mount: Darkcloud</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Nameplate Background: Ghost</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Nameplate Frame: Harbinger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Emoji Pack - Jon Snow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Iron Bank Marks x750</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Copper x50,000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Iron Bank Marks and Copper are virtual currencies used to purchase a wide variety of in-game items.</p>","developers":["Netmarble Neo"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3183280","name":"Game of Thrones: Kingsroad"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508440/39a728336ee5